      "content": "仓库已就绪，本地分支：main；提交：0b535f63302fe45e88d0b3e203ae991868ced079；文件树：753564ba0a09c0bed999dff17b540b09e581e8d9。\n证据 0b535f63302fe45e88d0b3e203ae991868ced079:pyproject.toml（SHA256 0168a0d3d9b20db9475110260aadfe09758a0175af085298423a1de63b02e4ad）：\n[build-system]\nrequires = [\"setuptools>=68\"]\nbuild-backend = \"setuptools.build_meta\"\n\n[project]\nname = \"spg-runtime\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\ndescription = \"Software Production Governor runtime foundation\"\nreadme = \"README.md\"\nrequires-python = \">=3.12\"\ndependencies = [\n    \"alembic>=1,<2\",\n    \"fastapi>=0.115,<1\",\n    \"httpx2>=2,<3\",\n    \"psycopg[binary]>=3,<4\",\n    \"pydantic>=2,<3\",\n    \"pydantic-settings>=2,<3\",\n    \"sqlalchemy>=2,<3\",\n    \"uvicorn>=0.30,<1\",\n]\n\n[project.optional-dependencies]\ncodex-executor = [\n    \"openai-codex==0.147.0\",\n    \"openai-codex-cli-bin==0.147.0\",\n]\ntest = [\n    \"pytest>=8,<10\",\n]\n\n[project.scripts]\nspg = \"spg.cli:main\"\n\n[tool.pytest.ini_options]\naddopts = \"-q\"\ntestpaths = [\"tests\"]\npythonpath = [\".\"]\nmarkers = [\n    \"postgresql: requires the explicitly configured real PostgreSQL test database\",\n    \"real_codex: requires explicit authorization for one real Codex SDK execution\",\n]\n\n[tool.setuptools.packages.find]\nwhere = [\"src\"]\n\n[tool.setuptools.package-data]\n\"spg.web\" = [\"*.html\", \"*.css\", \"*.js\"]\n\n生产 Work 尚未准入；没有修改源码或推送远端。",
